PARTITION BY for ranking data within groups
INNER JOIN for combining related tables
Subqueries / nested queries
Using WHERE to filter ranked results
Handling ties when multiple employees have the same highest salary

💡 Pattern to remember:

JOIN → RANK within groups → FILTER rank = 1

